WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.167 --> 00:00:02.502
-Good evening, everybody.
I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.502 --> 00:00:03.969
This is "Late Night."
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:03.969 --> 00:00:06.305
And now, if you don't mind,
we're gonna get to the news.

00:00:06.305 --> 00:00:09.309
Today is the Georgia
Senate runoff,

00:00:09.309 --> 00:00:11.711
and there's only one candidate
in the race

00:00:11.711 --> 00:00:13.880
who definitely knows that.

00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:16.382
[ Laughter ]

00:00:16.382 --> 00:00:19.051
Georgia Republican Senate
candidate Herschel Walker said

00:00:19.051 --> 00:00:20.553
during a rally over the weekend

00:00:20.553 --> 00:00:23.056
that he doesn't know
what a pronoun is.

00:00:23.056 --> 00:00:26.058
And someone said, "It's what you
call your illegitimate kids."

00:00:26.058 --> 00:00:28.061
And he said, "Oh, them?"

00:00:28.061 --> 00:00:31.564
[ Laughter ]

00:00:31.564 --> 00:00:34.400
That's right, Herschel Walker
said at a rally over the weekend

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:36.069
that he doesn't know
what a pronoun is.

00:00:36.069 --> 00:00:39.739
Okay, it cannot be good for
Raphael Warnock's self-esteem

00:00:39.739 --> 00:00:41.141
that this is a close race.

00:00:41.141 --> 00:00:43.977
I mean, imagine
seeing your opponent

00:00:43.977 --> 00:00:47.813
basically eating paste
on TV every night

00:00:47.813 --> 00:00:49.883
and knowing he might win.

00:00:49.883 --> 00:00:51.150
[ Laughter ]

00:00:51.150 --> 00:00:53.152
When asked yesterday about
former President Trump

00:00:53.152 --> 00:00:55.154
calling for the termination
of the Constitution,

00:00:55.154 --> 00:00:58.658
Nebraska Senator Ben Sasse
asked if Republicans

00:00:58.658 --> 00:01:01.828
"want to keep giving oxygen to
someone who is trying to sell

00:01:01.828 --> 00:01:04.364
tickets to his own
proprietary circus,

00:01:04.364 --> 00:01:06.966
or do they want to be
a constitutional party."

00:01:06.966 --> 00:01:09.135
Said Republicans,
"We're thinking."

00:01:09.135 --> 00:01:12.138
[ Laughter ]

00:01:12.138 --> 00:01:13.639
President Biden today toured

00:01:13.639 --> 00:01:15.874
a semiconductor
manufacturing company

00:01:15.874 --> 00:01:18.711
in Phoenix, Arizona,
and honestly, I don't even know

00:01:18.711 --> 00:01:20.546
if he did that because
he's the president

00:01:20.546 --> 00:01:22.548
or just because he's 80
and it's Tuesday.

00:01:22.548 --> 00:01:24.884
"Come on, kids!

00:01:24.884 --> 00:01:28.387
Come on.
It'll be interesting.

00:01:28.387 --> 00:01:32.392
My friend Frank works
over at the semiconductor place.

00:01:32.392 --> 00:01:34.060
He's gonna give us
a look at it.

00:01:34.060 --> 00:01:35.694
You have no idea!

00:01:35.694 --> 00:01:38.364
You use semiconductors
every day!"

00:01:38.364 --> 00:01:41.034
[ Laughter ]

00:01:41.034 --> 00:01:42.968
-In a new interview,
Eric Trump pushed back

00:01:42.968 --> 00:01:45.104
against reports that
the Trump family doesn't like

00:01:45.104 --> 00:01:47.440
Don Jr.'s fiancée,
Kimberly Guilfoyle.

00:01:47.440 --> 00:01:48.774
Okay, but keep in mind,

00:01:48.774 --> 00:01:50.977
he also thinks they like him.

00:01:50.977 --> 00:01:53.479
[ Laughter ]

00:01:53.479 --> 00:01:56.816
Indonesia's Parliament today
outlawed premarital sex.

00:01:56.816 --> 00:01:57.816
What?

00:01:57.816 --> 00:01:59.819
But that's the good kind.

00:01:59.819 --> 00:02:02.856
[ Laughter ]

00:02:05.658 --> 00:02:06.693
Eh...

00:02:08.594 --> 00:02:11.097
-A middle school nurse
in Florida was accused last week

00:02:11.097 --> 00:02:13.265
of taking more than 100
Adderall pills

00:02:13.265 --> 00:02:16.269
from at least five children
and replacing them with aspirin.

00:02:16.269 --> 00:02:18.270
And she had the right
to remain silent,

00:02:18.270 --> 00:02:20.940
but that's not an option
after 100 Adderall.

00:02:20.940 --> 00:02:23.075
"Okay, I wasn't supposed
to do that, but also,

00:02:23.075 --> 00:02:24.911
maybe it's okay because that
means someone down the road

00:02:24.911 --> 00:02:26.412
will know not to do it,
so that's actually

00:02:26.412 --> 00:02:27.746
for the greater good
when you think about it.

00:02:27.746 --> 00:02:29.115
And you know what else?
I should totally write

00:02:29.115 --> 00:02:30.949
a novel about this!"

00:02:30.949 --> 00:02:32.618
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:32.618 --> 00:02:34.186
Thank you. [ Chuckles ]

00:02:34.186 --> 00:02:36.455
[ Applause continues ]

00:02:36.455 --> 00:02:38.625
And that was Adderall Theater.

00:02:38.625 --> 00:02:39.792
[ Laughter ]

00:02:39.792 --> 00:02:41.193
It was recently announced that

00:02:41.193 --> 00:02:43.629
the Ripley's Believe It or Not!
Museum in Atlantic City

00:02:43.629 --> 00:02:45.464
will close at the end
of the year,

00:02:45.464 --> 00:02:47.533
because when you walk
around Atlantic City,

00:02:47.533 --> 00:02:50.003
anything becomes believable.

00:02:50.003 --> 00:02:51.370
[ Laughter ]

00:02:51.370 --> 00:02:53.740
And finally, a charity
in Australia recently attempted

00:02:53.740 --> 00:02:55.074
to break a Guinness World Record

00:02:55.074 --> 00:02:57.910
by lining up nearly 1,100
wrapped presents.

00:02:57.910 --> 00:02:59.979
It would beat the previous
record holder --

00:02:59.979 --> 00:03:02.481
someone whose parents
just got divorced.

00:03:02.481 --> 00:03:05.518
[ Laughter and groans ]

00:03:07.987 --> 00:03:10.656
-And that's a Merry Christmas
monologue joke

00:03:10.656 --> 00:03:14.493
from the monster Mike Scollins.

00:03:14.493 --> 00:03:17.897
That was a monologue, everybody.
We're off and running!

